{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49511","headline":"临江仙 二 · 鹿虔扆","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无赖晓莺惊梦断，起来残酒初醒。\n映窗丝柳嫋烟青。\n翠帘慵卷，约砌杏花零。\n一自玉郎游冶去，莲凋月惨仪形。\n暮天微雨洒闲庭。\n手挼裙带，无语倚云屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鹿虔扆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}